1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:02,088
Banyak yang mengira,

2
00:00:02,088 --> 00:00:05,256
kinerja guru cukup dinilai dari kesan.

3
00:00:05,256 --> 00:00:07,624
Padahal penilaian dari kesan,

4
00:00:07,624 --> 00:00:09,850
sering terasa tidak adil.

5
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:13,492
Penilaian kinerja guru perlu dibuat adil.

6
00:00:14,562 --> 00:00:18,499
Penilaian yang adil itu dijaga oleh empat hal.

7
00:00:18,499 --> 00:00:21,050
Pertama, kriteria disepakati,

8
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:23,750
dan dibaca guru sebelum dinilai.

9
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:26,855
Kedua, penilaian dilihat dari bukti,

10
00:00:26,855 --> 00:00:29,588
berupa dokumen dan pengamatan.

11
00:00:29,588 --> 00:00:31,723
Ketiga, ada waktu bicara,

12
00:00:31,723 --> 00:00:34,254
supaya guru boleh menanggapi.

13
00:00:34,254 --> 00:00:36,465
Keempat, ada tindak lanjut,

14
00:00:36,465 --> 00:00:39,301
berupa pelatihan sesuai kebutuhan.

15
00:00:39,301 --> 00:00:43,452
Empat hal inilah yang menjaga penilaian kinerja guru,

16
00:00:43,452 --> 00:00:44,808
tetap adil.

17
00:00:44,808 --> 00:00:46,586
Dan saat penilaian adil,

18
00:00:46,586 --> 00:00:49,262
guru jadi lebih semangat mengajar.

19
00:00:49,332 --> 00:00:54,899
Akadiva by SABIHA Edu, membantu sekolah mencatat jurnal mengajar guru,

20
00:00:54,899 --> 00:00:58,242
supaya penilaian punya data yang jelas.
